Z||000000||1FST2M6||06-14-2000||10:24 AM||||<P><BR>Well ladies and gentleman… after about 2 weeks of E-mailing pics, FedEx’n Video tapes, Receipts and pics... A little Pleading with my girlfriend’s father.  GT Bastard and I will be swapping/selling our cars to each other. Lyndsay (my girlfriend) and myself will be driving both my SE and Her Saturn SC, leaving Marietta, Ga. Friday June 30th around 3pm to arrive in Sioux Falls, SD by mid morning July 1st . Once the swap has been made and both parties happy I will then continue on to Billings, MT where my girlfriends dad will ship my new GT back to Atlanta for me so I don’t have to drop another $200 in gas getting it home. Jeff Kendall being the great guy he is, is willing to split the cost of gas from Atl. to Sioux Falls. We will keep you posted on our journey and the swap as this unfolds. I’m SOOOO glad my car has Konis on it... so I won’t need a kidney belt or a new spine... just open up the valves and have that sloppy caddy ride everyone loves on that 17 hour 1200 mile trip. <BR>	And Jeff talking $*IT said his girlfriend and her Automatic Eclipse could hang with My girlfriend and her  +30 overbore 2.1liter DOHC 5spd Saturn… heehehe J Lynds said she’ll wipe the floor with her… so not only is there a Great Fiero Swap going on, there will be a bit of a cat fight drag/grudge match.  J   OUR WOMEN are AWSOME! That sounds possessive… just couldn’t think of another way to say it.<BR>	For those who aren’t familiar with our cars he has a Burgundy 87 GT automatic with near perfect interior and in need of a little front-end framework and repainting… and basically stock suspension and motor. I however have a Gold 86 SE 4spd with a 4:10 gear. With VERY little stock suspension and many motor mods. His car being pretty and automatic is what I want and he’s looking for a fast manual car. He approached me about this and we are now only about 15 days away. <BR>	I’m thinking of changing my handle to 1KwkGT… but that will be a while… <P>Thank you Jeff and I hope you liked the tape and all the receipts I sent.<P>The following are pics of our cars… <P><BR>||||reg||1
